Package: altfs
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 libaltfs0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 fuse
Description: Aurora LTFS filesystem tools and FUSE daemon
 Aurora LTFS lets you mount LTFS-formatted tapes as a regular filesystem
 using FUSE. This package provides the altfs FUSE daemon plus the mkaltfs,
 altfsck and altfsindextool utilities, along with the tape / iosched / kmi
 plugins loaded at runtime.

Package: libaltfs0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Aurora LTFS shared library
 Shared library used by Aurora LTFS commands and plugins. This package
 provides the runtime libaltfs.so.* needed to run altfs/mkaltfs/altfsck.

Package: libaltfs-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libaltfs0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Aurora LTFS development files
 Header files and pkg-config metadata for building software against
 libaltfs.
